Pako Engineers - Sleeve Dimension and Tolerance Chart

Wear sleeves and bushes are manufactured for mechanical seal zones, bearing areas, and shaft protection duties.

Typical capability:
- Outside diameter: 50 mm to 1500 mm
- Inside diameter: 50 mm to 500 mm, bored and ground
- Length: up to 1000 mm
- Surface finish: up to Ra 0.2 microns
- Concentricity: within 0.005 mm
- Hardness: up to 60 HRC depending on material and treatment

Recommended documents for RFQ: drawing, material grade, seal area finish, hardness requirement, and quantity.
